import source_queries.dl

class:
    patterns:
        UI language work
    members:
        step as an integer
        payload as a pointer to JSON value

class:
    patterns:
        UI language client
    members:
        root as a string
        phase as an integer
        opened as a boolean
        document as a pointer to UI source document
        desired as a pointer to UI source document
        uri as a string
        context as a string
        profiles as a string
        snapshot as a string
        revision as an integer
        version as an integer
        token types as a pointer to JSON value
        token epoch as an integer
        query as a pointer to UI source query
        query generation as an integer
        query notification as a boolean
        replies as a pointer to JSON value
        reply index as an integer
        continuation as UI language work
        continuation phase as an integer

to get [a UI language client rooted at] {string:root}:
    set client to storage for one slot initialized with (a new UI language client)
    set client's root to root
    set client's token types to a new JSON-RPC array
    set client's replies to a new JSON-RPC array
    return client

to [free UI language client] {a pointer to UI language client:client}:
    free client's token types
    free client's replies
    if client's continuation's payload != @intrinsic("construct", a pointer to JSON value):
        free client's continuation's payload
    destroy the value at client
    deallocate client
